        "explanation": "<h3>Per Cent = Per 100</h3><p>A percentage is a special fraction with a denominator of 100.</p><ul><li>50% = 50/100 = 1/2 = 0.5</li><li>10% = 10/100 = 1/10 = 0.1</li></ul><h4>Calculating %</h4><ul><li><strong>Of Amount:</strong> 10% of 50 -> 50 ÷ 10 = 5.</li><li><strong>Increase:</strong> Multiply by 1.X (e.g., +20% -> × 1.2).</li><li><strong>Decrease:</strong> Multiply by 0.X (e.g., -20% -> × 0.8).</li></ul>",
